{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013wSLPduhEWRZC48kWpSNxW","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# About page\n2\t\n3\tPage type: about\n4\t\n5\tAbout Larkspur Supply Co..\n6\t\n7\tOur story: Twelve paddlers and climbers founded the co-op in 1987 in a rented garage. Today 9,400 members own it, and every member gets one vote at the annual meeting.\n8\t\n9\tWhat we believe (three principles):\n10\t1. Repair before replace. Our workshop fixed 3,100 items last year.\n11\t2. Pay people fairly. Every employee earns at least the regional living wage.\n12\t3. Leave places better. We give 2% of sales to trail and shoreline groups.\n13\t\n14\tMilestones:\n15\t- 1987: Founded in a garage on Pier Road.\n16\t- 1999: Opened the Alder Street store.\n17\t- 2014: Started the rental program.\n18\t- 2023: Opened the repair workshop.\n19\t\n20\tA quote from the board chair, Ines Okafor: \"We are not here to sell more gear. We are here to help people get outside with the gear they already have.\"\n21\t\n22\tLinks: Read the annual report (/reports/2025.pdf), Meet the team (/team).\n23\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9fd0fb0b-7368-4a4e-96e9-967ff989faac","uuid":"496f5c3f-13b3-4bab-906e-7a6fa0f47542","timestamp":"2026-10-18T13:20:08.430Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/user/htmlverify/eval/results/2026-10-18-pilot-abc/about/B-1/work/brief.md","content":"# About page\n\nPage type: about\n\nAbout Larkspur Supply Co..\n\nOur story: Twelve paddlers and climbers founded the co-op in 1987 in a rented garage. Today 9,400 members own it, and every member gets one vote at the annual meeting.\n\nWhat we believe (three principles):\n1. Repair before replace. Our workshop fixed 3,100 items last year.\n2. Pay people fairly. Every employee earns at least the regional living wage.\n3. Leave places better. We give 2% of sales to trail and shoreline groups.\n\nMilestones:\n- 1987: Founded in a garage on Pier Road.\n- 1999: Opened the Alder Street store.\n- 2014: Started the rental program.\n- 2023: Opened the repair workshop.\n\nA quote from the board chair, Ines Okafor: \"We are not here to sell more gear. We are here to help people get outside with the gear they already have.\"\n\nLinks: Read the annual report (/reports/2025.pdf), Meet the team (/team).\n","numLines":23,"startLine":1,"totalLines":23}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_013wSLPduhEWRZC48kWpSNxW","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
