{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg9mefsctoHUR7AHD3Ksw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013eewZNcXQcKqrQi1uxdwcT","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/home/user/htmlverify/eval/results/2026-10-18-pilot-abc/about/B-1/work/page.html","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\"/>\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/>\n  <title>About Larkspur Supply Co.</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/vb/vanilla-breeze.css\"/>\n  <script src=\"/vb/vanilla-breeze.js\" defer=\"defer\"></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <header>\n    <h1>About Larkspur Supply Co.</h1>\n  </header>\n\n  <main id=\"main\">\n    <section>\n      <h2>Our story</h2>\n      <p>Twelve paddlers and climbers founded the co-op in 1987 in a rented garage. Today 9,400 members own it, and every member gets one vote at the annual meeting.</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section>\n      <h2>What we believe</h2>\n      <ol>\n        <li>Repair before replace. Our workshop fixed 3,100 items last year.</li>\n        <li>Pay people fairly. Every employee earns at least the regional living wage.</li>\n        <li>Leave places better. We give 2% of sales to trail and shoreline groups.</li>\n      </ol>\n    </section>\n\n    <section>\n      <h2>Milestones</h2>\n      <ul>\n        <li>1987: Founded in a garage on Pier Road.</li>\n        <li>1999: Opened the Alder Street store.</li>\n        <li>2014: Started the rental program.</li>\n        <li>2023: Opened the repair workshop.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n\n    <figure>\n      <blockquote>\n        <p>We are not here to sell more gear. We are here to help people get outside with the gear they already have.</p>\n      </blockquote>\n      <figcaption>Ines Okafor, board chair</figcaption>\n    </figure>\n\n    <nav aria-label=\"Related links\">\n      <ul>\n        <li><a href=\"/reports/2025.pdf\">Read th